{
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "title": "Exchange",
  "uid": "basetool-exchange",
  "tags": [
    "basetool"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "1m",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "type": "query",
        "name": "client_id",
        "label": "Client",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": "label_values({__name__=~\"basetool_ingest_exchange_(refused|relay)_total\", client_id!=\"none\"}, client_id)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Traffic and refusals",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Relayed requests/min per client and outcome",
      "description": "Admitted exchange requests the gateway relayed to the backend, per registry client: ok, refused by the backend with an exchange error code, or failed (answered 502 BACKEND_RELAY_FAILED; ExchangeRelayFailing). REQ-XCH-011, REQ-XCH-028.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqpm",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (client_id, outcome) (rate(basetool_ingest_exchange_relay_total{client_id=~\"$client_id\", client_id!=\"none\"}[5m])) * 60",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{client_id}} {{outcome}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1
      },
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Gateway refusals/hour per client",
      "description": "Exchange requests the gateway refused, per client label: a registry client id, 'unregistered' for a token of a client outside the registry, 'unknown' while the registry cannot be read. Refusals before a token names a client ('none') are left out. ExchangeClientRefusalsSpike and ExchangeUnknownClient alert on these. REQ-XCH-028.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (client_id) (increase(basetool_ingest_exchange_refused_total{client_id=~\"$client_id\", client_id!=\"none\"}[1h]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{client_id}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Gateway refusals/hour by reason",
      "description": "The gateway's refusals of the selected clients by problem code in snake case (dpop_invalid, client_suspended, scope_missing, rate_limited, quota_exceeded, registry_unavailable, ...). REQ-XCH-028. The normal DPoP nonce round trip is no refusal and is not counted here; it shows as use_dpop_nonce on the ingest auth failures.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (reason) (increase(basetool_ingest_exchange_refused_total{client_id=~\"$client_id\"}[1h])) > 0",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{reason}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 9
      },
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Idempotent replays/hour",
      "description": "Exchange writes the gateway answered from the idempotency cache instead of running them again (REQ-XCH-020). Not per client.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(basetool_ingest_exchange_idempotent_replays_total[1h]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "replays",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 17
      },
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "DPoP replay-cache refusals/hour by path scope and reason",
      "description": "DPoP proofs the gateway's jti replay cache refused, per path scope (exchange / other) and reason: replayed (the jti was used before), member_cap (the member already holds its app.exchange.limits.dpop-proofs-per-member live proofs) or full (the scope's cache holds dpop-proofs-total and refuses every new proof; IngestDpopReplayCacheFull fires). On the exchange scope a member_cap refusal is answered 429 DPOP_PROOF_LIMIT and counts as dpop_proof_limit on the auth-failure counter, and a full refusal is answered 503 SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE and counts as dpop_store_full; every other refusal counts as invalid_dpop_proof (REQ-XCH-006). The metric carries no client, so the client_id variable does not filter it.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (path_scope, reason) (increase(basetool_ingest_dpop_replay_refused_total[1h]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{path_scope}} {{reason}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 17
      },
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Org stock pages/hour per client",
      "description": "Org-stock snapshot and feed pages the backend served (GET /exchange/v1/org-stock), per registry client: the shared stock of the units the reading member directly belongs to. A steep rise is a client polling too often or re-reading the snapshot instead of following the feed. REQ-XCH-042, ADR-0257.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (client_id) (increase(basetool_exchange_org_stock_pages_total{client_id=~\"$client_id\"}[1h]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{client_id}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 25
      },
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Writes to members' data",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 26
      },
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Writes/day by resource and outcome",
      "description": "Ops the selected clients sent to members' synced data (REQ-XCH-015 to -017): applied, unchanged, unmatched, ambiguous or rejected, plus 'held' per change set the mass-change guard held back (REQ-XCH-021; ExchangeGuardStorm).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (resource, outcome) (increase(basetool_exchange_writes_total{client_id=~\"$client_id\"}[1d]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{resource}} {{outcome}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 26
      },
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Removals/hour per client and resource",
      "description": "Removals the selected clients committed to members' entries, counted by the journal after commit. ExchangeRemoveSpike fires above 100 an hour for one client (REQ-XCH-028).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (client_id, resource) (increase(basetool_exchange_removals_total{client_id=~\"$client_id\"}[1h]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{client_id}} {{resource}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 34
      },
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Mass changes/day: staged, resent and confirmed",
      "description": "Change sets the mass-change guard held back and the gateway staged for the member's confirmation, per client, the resends of a still-waiting held batch the gateway answered with the same link (ADR-0281; ExchangeHeldBatchResent), and the ones members confirmed, per client and resource (REQ-XCH-021).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (client_id) (increase(basetool_ingest_exchange_mass_changes_staged_total{client_id=~\"$client_id\", client_id!=\"none\"}[1d]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "staged {{client_id}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum by (client_id, resource) (increase(basetool_exchange_mass_changes_confirmed_total{client_id=~\"$client_id\"}[1d]))",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "confirmed {{client_id}} {{resource}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum by (client_id) (increase(basetool_ingest_exchange_mass_changes_repeated_total{client_id=~\"$client_id\", client_id!=\"none\"}[1d]))",
          "refId": "C",
          "legendFormat": "resent {{client_id}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 34
      },
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Undo/day by resource and outcome",
      "description": "Entries a member's undo of a client's writes restored or skipped, per client and resource (REQ-XCH-022).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (client_id, resource, outcome) (increase(basetool_exchange_undo_total{client_id=~\"$client_id\"}[1d]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{client_id}} {{resource}} {{outcome}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 42
      },
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Connections",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 43
      },
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Installations created/day per client",
      "description": "Installations of the selected clients seen for the first time. ExchangeInstallationSurge fires above 20 an hour for one client (REQ-XCH-007, REQ-XCH-028).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (client_id) (increase(basetool_exchange_installations_created_total{client_id=~\"$client_id\"}[1d]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{client_id}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 43
      },
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Account checks and disconnects/day",
      "description": "Exchange account checks by answer (match / mismatch / unknown; a rising mismatch share means clients see alt accounts, REQ-XCH-031) and members disconnecting one installation or a whole client (REQ-XCH-008). Not per client.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (outcome) (increase(basetool_exchange_account_checks_total[1d]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "check {{outcome}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum by (kind) (increase(basetool_exchange_disconnects_total[1d]))",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "disconnect {{kind}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 51
      },
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Registry and budget",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 52
      },
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Registry clients by status",
      "description": "The clients in the exchange registry per status, refreshed by the backend's 60-second reconcile and on every committed registry change (REQ-XCH-003, REQ-XCH-028). Registry changes themselves are announced by ExchangeRegistryChanged.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (status) (basetool_exchange_clients)",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 52
      },
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Registry mirror age at the gateway",
      "description": "Seconds since the ingest gateway last read the registry mirror successfully; it reads it every 30 seconds, so a healthy gateway stays below about 35 s. Empty (NaN) before the first read. ExchangeRegistryMirrorStaleAtGateway fires above 300 s for 10 minutes while the backend's mirror is enabled (REQ-XCH-003, REQ-XCH-028).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max by (instance) (basetool_exchange_registry_mirror_age_seconds)",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 52
      },
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Exchange Redis byte budget in use",
      "description": "The share of the exchange's 64 MiB Redis byte budget the gateway's cached answers, quota counters and locks hold (REQ-XCH-023). ExchangeBudgetHigh fires above 0.8; at 1.0 writes are refused EXCHANGE_BUDGET_EXHAUSTED.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10
          },
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max(basetool_ingest_exchange_budget_used_ratio)",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "used",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 52
      },
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Exchange Redis byte budget in use per client",
      "description": "The share of each selected client's 16 MiB Redis byte budget its cached answers, quota counters and staged drafts hold (REQ-XCH-023). ExchangeClientBudgetHigh fires above 0.8; when it is full every write of that client's members is refused EXCHANGE_BUDGET_EXHAUSTED, while the total's gauge beside it can still read a quarter. Last measured on the client's latest write.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
